1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Before you confirm any Sepolia transaction,
always check the gas fee in your wallet first.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Look at the estimated cost shown in both
ETH and USD so you know exactly what you will pay.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Tap the gas settings to compare slow,
average, and fast transaction speeds.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Review the final gas total and tap confirm
only when you are ready.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Visit https://example.org/gas-diary for
more wallet tips.